sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Person in Jira
    participant J as Jira Cloud
    participant A as Express API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant S as React SPA
    P->>J: moves TECHEA-3 to In Progress
    J->>A: POST /integrations/jira/webhook (X-Hub-Signature)
    A->>A: verify HMAC-SHA256 of the raw body
    alt invalid signature
        A-->>J: 401 INVALID_SIGNATURE
    else valid
        A->>D: ticket with jira_issue_id = 10003?
        alt not tracked, or event older than last_synced_at
            A-->>J: 204 (ignored)
        else tracked and newer
            A->>D: BEGIN, set_config app.user_id = Integración Jira
            A->>D: UPDATE status, category, summary, key, parent, last_synced_at
            D->>D: audit trigger records the change
            A->>D: COMMIT
            A-->>J: 204
        end
    end
    S->>A: GET /screens/12/jira-tickets
    A-->>S: 200 tree with the new status
